{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04424","headline":"度峡口山赠乔补阙知之王二无竞 · 陈子昂","name":"度峡口山赠乔补阙知之王二无竞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峡口大漠南，横绝界中国。\n丛石何纷糺，赤山复翕赩。\n远望多衆容，逼之无异色。\n崔崒乍孤断，逶迤屡回直。\n信关胡马冲，亦距汉边塞。\n岂依河山险，将顺休明德。\n物壮诚有衰，势雄良易极。\n逦迤忽而尽，泱漭平不息。\n之子黄金躯，如何此荒域。\n云台盛多士，待君丹墀侧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04424.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04424","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}